```mermaid
flowchart TD
    CODE_COMPLETE[Development Complete] --> RELEASE_PREP[Release Preparation]

    RELEASE_PREP --> DOCS[📝 Technical Writer<br/>• Architecture docs<br/>• API documentation<br/>• User guides<br/>• Deployment guides]

    DOCS --> SECURITY[🔐 Security Engineer<br/>• OWASP scanning<br/>• Dependency audit<br/>• Compliance checks<br/>• Vulnerability assessment]

    SECURITY --> SECURITY_CHECK{Security Issues?}
    SECURITY_CHECK -->|Critical| SECURITY_FAIL[🛑 Stop Pipeline<br/>Fix security issues]
    SECURITY_CHECK -->|Minor| SECURITY_WARN[⚠️ Log warnings<br/>Continue pipeline]
    SECURITY_CHECK -->|Pass| SECURITY_PASS[✅ Security validated]

    SECURITY_FAIL --> SECURITY[Return to Security Engineer]
    SECURITY_WARN --> PACKAGE
    SECURITY_PASS --> PACKAGE[📦 Release Engineer<br/>• Version bumping<br/>• Changelog generation<br/>• Asset optimization<br/>• Artifact creation]

    PACKAGE --> INFRA_CHOICE{Deployment Strategy?}

    %% Traditional DevOps Path (Stage 4)
    INFRA_CHOICE -->|Traditional| INFRA_GEN[🚀 DevOps Engineer<br/>Infrastructure Generation]

    INFRA_GEN --> IaC[Infrastructure as Code<br/>• Terraform for AWS/GCP/Azure<br/>• Docker containers<br/>• Kubernetes manifests<br/>• Environment configs]

    IaC --> CICD[CI/CD Pipeline Generation<br/>• GitHub Actions workflows<br/>• Build automation<br/>• Test execution<br/>• Deployment automation]

    CICD --> STAGING_DEPLOY[Deploy to Staging<br/>• Infrastructure provisioning<br/>• Application deployment<br/>• Database migration<br/>• Service configuration]

    STAGING_DEPLOY --> STAGING_VERIFY[🧪 Staging Verification<br/>• Health checks<br/>• Integration tests<br/>• Performance tests<br/>• User acceptance tests]

    STAGING_VERIFY --> STAGING_GATE{Staging Pass?}
    STAGING_GATE -->|Fail| STAGING_FIX[Fix staging issues]
    STAGING_GATE -->|Pass| PROD_DEPLOY[Deploy to Production<br/>• Blue-green deployment<br/>• Database migrations<br/>• Service rollout<br/>• DNS updates]

    STAGING_FIX --> STAGING_DEPLOY

    PROD_DEPLOY --> PROD_VERIFY[🚀 Production Verification<br/>• Health monitoring<br/>• Performance metrics<br/>• Error rate monitoring<br/>• User traffic analysis]

    %% Quick Deploy Path (Stage 5)
    INFRA_CHOICE -->|Quick Deploy| PLATFORM_CHOICE[🚀 SRE Deploy Engineer<br/>Platform Selection]

    PLATFORM_CHOICE --> FRONTEND_PLATFORMS[Frontend Platforms]
    PLATFORM_CHOICE --> BACKEND_PLATFORMS[Backend Platforms]
    PLATFORM_CHOICE --> DATABASE_PLATFORMS[Database Platforms]
    PLATFORM_CHOICE --> FULLSTACK_PLATFORMS[Full-Stack Platforms]

    %% Frontend Platform Options
    FRONTEND_PLATFORMS --> VERCEL[Vercel<br/>• Next.js optimized<br/>• Global CDN<br/>• Automatic HTTPS<br/>• Preview deployments]

    FRONTEND_PLATFORMS --> NETLIFY[Netlify<br/>• JAMstack focus<br/>• Form handling<br/>• Split testing<br/>• Identity management]

    FRONTEND_PLATFORMS --> CLOUDFLARE[Cloudflare Pages<br/>• Global edge network<br/>• Fast builds<br/>• DDoS protection<br/>• Analytics]

    %% Backend Platform Options
    BACKEND_PLATFORMS --> RAILWAY[Railway<br/>• Database included<br/>• Auto-scaling<br/>• Git-based deployment<br/>• Environment management]

    BACKEND_PLATFORMS --> FLYIO[Fly.io<br/>• Global deployment<br/>• Docker native<br/>• Edge computing<br/>• Persistent storage]

    BACKEND_PLATFORMS --> RENDER[Render<br/>• Simple deployment<br/>• Auto-scaling<br/>• SSL certificates<br/>• Background jobs]

    %% Database Platform Options
    DATABASE_PLATFORMS --> NEON[Neon<br/>• PostgreSQL<br/>• Serverless scaling<br/>• Branch management<br/>• Connection pooling]

    DATABASE_PLATFORMS --> PLANETSCALE[PlanetScale<br/>• MySQL<br/>• Database branching<br/>• Schema migrations<br/>• Global replication]

    DATABASE_PLATFORMS --> SUPABASE[Supabase<br/>• PostgreSQL<br/>• Real-time features<br/>• Authentication<br/>• Storage]

    %% Full-Stack Options
    FULLSTACK_PLATFORMS --> RAILWAY_FULL[Railway Full-Stack<br/>• Frontend + Backend + DB<br/>• Monorepo support<br/>• Service linking<br/>• Environment variables]

    %% Platform Deployment Process
    VERCEL --> PLATFORM_DEPLOY[Platform Deployment Process]
    NETLIFY --> PLATFORM_DEPLOY
    CLOUDFLARE --> PLATFORM_DEPLOY
    RAILWAY --> PLATFORM_DEPLOY
    FLYIO --> PLATFORM_DEPLOY
    RENDER --> PLATFORM_DEPLOY
    NEON --> PLATFORM_DEPLOY
    PLANETSCALE --> PLATFORM_DEPLOY
    SUPABASE --> PLATFORM_DEPLOY
    RAILWAY_FULL --> PLATFORM_DEPLOY

    PLATFORM_DEPLOY --> PLATFORM_STEPS[1. Push code to Git<br/>2. Platform builds automatically<br/>3. Deploy to platform infrastructure<br/>4. Configure custom domain<br/>5. Setup SSL certificates<br/>6. Configure environment variables<br/>7. Setup monitoring]

    PLATFORM_STEPS --> PLATFORM_VERIFY[Platform Verification<br/>• Health check endpoints<br/>• SSL certificate validation<br/>• Performance monitoring<br/>• Error tracking setup]

    %% Monitoring Setup
    PROD_VERIFY --> MONITORING_SETUP[🛡️ SRE Ops Engineer<br/>Monitoring & Operations]
    PLATFORM_VERIFY --> MONITORING_SETUP

    MONITORING_SETUP --> OBSERVABILITY[Observability Stack<br/>• Application metrics<br/>• Infrastructure monitoring<br/>• Log aggregation<br/>• Distributed tracing]

    OBSERVABILITY --> ALERTING[Alerting Configuration<br/>• Error rate thresholds<br/>• Performance degradation<br/>• Uptime monitoring<br/>• Security incidents]

    ALERTING --> SLO_SETUP[SLO Definition<br/>• Availability targets<br/>• Response time goals<br/>• Error rate limits<br/>• Performance benchmarks]

    %% Final State
    SLO_SETUP --> OPERATIONAL[🎉 System Operational<br/>• Live and accessible<br/>• Monitored and alerting<br/>• Performance tracked<br/>• Support processes active]

    %% Rollback Capability
    OPERATIONAL --> ROLLBACK_READY[Rollback Capability<br/>• Previous version available<br/>• Database backup/restore<br/>• Traffic switching<br/>• Emergency procedures]

    %% Continuous Operations
    ROLLBACK_READY --> CONTINUOUS[Continuous Operations<br/>• Performance monitoring<br/>• Incident response<br/>• Capacity planning<br/>• Security updates]

    %% Style classes
    classDef stage4 fill:#E6F3FF,stroke:#4169E1,stroke-width:2px
    classDef stage5 fill:#F0FFF0,stroke:#32CD32,stroke-width:2px
    classDef platform fill:#FFE4B5,stroke:#D2691E,stroke-width:1px
    classDef security fill:#FFE4E1,stroke:#DC143C,stroke-width:2px
    classDef monitoring fill:#F5F5DC,stroke:#8B4513,stroke-width:2px

    class INFRA_GEN,IaC,CICD,STAGING_DEPLOY stage4
    class PLATFORM_CHOICE,PLATFORM_DEPLOY,PLATFORM_STEPS,PLATFORM_VERIFY stage5
    class VERCEL,NETLIFY,CLOUDFLARE,RAILWAY,FLYIO,RENDER,NEON,PLANETSCALE,SUPABASE platform
    class SECURITY,SECURITY_CHECK,SECURITY_FAIL security
    class MONITORING_SETUP,OBSERVABILITY,ALERTING,SLO_SETUP,OPERATIONAL monitoring
```